DIGGS dictionaries

The code lists in codes/, properties.xml and DiggsUomDictionary.xml are copies of the
DIGGS dictionaries published at https://diggsml.org/def from
https://github.com/DIGGSml/def, at the commit recorded in ../PROVENANCE.toml.

The DIGGSml/def README states: "This project is licensed under the MIT License". At the
recorded commit the repository contains no LICENSE file and no copyright line; a request
for one has been raised with the DIGGS project. The MIT License terms the README refers
to are reproduced below.

DIGGSTestPropertyDefinitions.xml and whiteList.xml are maintained in pyDIGGS
(Apache-2.0); whiteList.xml started from DIGGSml/def docs/validation/whiteList.xml.

